  "story": {
    "day": 166,
    "title": "Kaya's Swim Race",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya walked to the school swimming pool.",
      "The summer heat was strong today.",
      "First, she went to the restroom quickly.",
      "Then, she put on her swimsuit.",
      "Her friend Mei was waiting there.",
      "Mei said, \"We'll swim 2 laps, Kaya. You'll do great!\"",
      "Kaya certainly won't give up.",
      "She put her left foot forward and stretched her hand.",
      "The coach called, \"You mustn't run!\"",
      "Kaya knew she'll try her best.",
      "Soon, the starting ring will sound.",
      "They'll all race very hard."
    ]
  }
